ArenaForge product site display layer

The Astro, Tailwind, and GSAP presentation structure in this directory was
developed from the public apple-style-portfolio template:

  https://github.com/larry-xue/apple-style-portfolio
  upstream revision: dbcc368a257e49f61f007f64c535b7b8967a21b3

The upstream project declares the MIT License in its package metadata and
repository documentation. ArenaForge removes its portfolio content, React,
Three.js, original media, and product branding. This notice is intentionally
not linked from the public product site.
